        <tr > 
          <td height='411' colspan='2'> 
            <table width='100%' border='0' align='center' bgcolor='#CCFFFF' height='483'>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan='2'> 
                  <div align='center'><b><font color='#800080' size='4' face='Arial'><u><span style='mso-bidi-font-size: 10.0pt'><font color='#000066'>CYPRUS</font></span></u></font></b></div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan='2'> 
                  <div align='justify'><b><font face='Arial' size='2'>AS PER RECENT 
                    NOTIFICATION FROM 'HIGH COMMISSION OF THE REPUBLIC OF CYPRUS' 
                    NEW DELHI, WITH IMMEDIATE EFFECT VISA REQUIREMENT ARE AS FOLLOWS.</font> 
                    </b></div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan='2'><b><font size='2' face='Arial'><font color='#FF6600'>BUSINESS 
                  VISA REQUIREMENTS : </font></font></b></td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td width='4%' valign='top'><b><font size='2' face='Arial'>1.</font></b></td>
                <td width='96%'> 
                  <div align='justify'><b><font size='2' face='Arial'>THE VISA 
                    APPLICATION MUST BE DULY COMPLETED AND SIGNED BY. THE APPLICANT. 
                    ONE RECENT PASSPORT SIZE PHOTOGRAPH TO BE FFIXED ON THE APPLICATION 
                    FORM. </font></b></div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td width='4%' valign='top' height='2'><b>2.</b></td>
                <td width='96%' height='2'> 
                  <div align='justify'><b><font size='2' face='Arial'>THE PASSPORT 
                    MUST BE VALID FOR AT LEAST SIX MONTHS FROM THE DATE OF ENTRY 
                    INTO CYPRUS. PREVIOUS PASSPORTS MAY ALSO BE REQUIRED. </font></b></div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td width='4%'><font face='Arial' size='2'><b>3.</b></font></td>
                <td width='96%'><b><font size='2' face='Arial'>CONFIRMED OR ONWARD 
                  RETURN TICKET. </font></b></td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td width='4%' valign='top' height='2'><font face='Arial' size='2'><b>4.</b></font></td>
                <td width='96%' height='2'> 
                  <p align='justify'><b><font size='2' face='Arial'> A COVERING LETTER 
                    EXPLAINING THE REASON OF YOUR TRIP TO CYPRUS (I.E., THE SUBJECT 
                    THAT WILL BE DISCUSSED, DURATION OF TRIP, SPONSORSHIP OF AIR 
                    TICKET, TRAVEL EXPENSES) </font></b></p>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td width='4%' valign='top' height='2'><font face='Arial' size='2'><b>5.</b></font></td>
                <td width='96%' height='2'> 
                  <div align='justify'><b><font size='2' face='Arial'> CONFIRMATION 
                    FROM HOTEL IN CYPRUS ABOUT THE RESERVATION MADE WITH REGARD 
                    TO THE APPLICATION. THE CONFIRMATION SHOULD BE FAXED OVER 
                    TO THE HIGH COMMISSION FROM THE HOTEL ITSELF. </font></b></div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td width='4%' height='2' valign='top'><font face='Arial' size='2'><b>6.</b></font></td>
                <td width='96%' height='2'>
                  <div align='justify'><font face='Arial' size='2'><b>SUFFICIENT 
                    FUNDS (WITH RECEIPT IN ORIGINAL & COPY BOTH) MUST BE ENDORSED 
                    ON THE PASSPORT, AT LEAST U.S.$ 2,000 FOR A FIFTEEN DAYS STAY 
                    IN CYPRUS. THE ENDORSEMENT SHOULD MAKE A REFERENCE TO CYPRUS 
                    AS THE COUNTRY OF DESTINATION. (COPY OF INTERNATIONAL CREDIT 
                    CARDS, TRAVELER'S CHEQUES, FOREIGN EXCHANGE, <font color='#FF0033'>BOTH 
                    ORIGINAL</font> AND COPY OF SALARY CERTIFICATE AND TAX DECLARATION). 
                    </b></font></div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td width='4%' valign='top' height='2'> 
                  <p><font face='Arial' size='2'><b>7.</b></font></p>
                </td>
                <td width='96%' height='2'> 
                  <div align='justify'><font face='Arial' size='2'><b>INDIVIDUAL 
                    BANK STATEMENT FOR THE LAST SIX MONTHS ALONG WITH BANK CERTIFICATE 
                    <font color='#FF0033'>BOTH IN ORIGINAL</font>.</b></font></div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td width='4%' valign='top'><font face='Arial' size='2'><b>8.</b></font></td>
                <td width='96%'>
                  <div align='justify'><font face='Arial' size='2'><b>A DETAILED 
                    LETTER FROM THE EMPLOYER OR COMPANY CONFIRMING THE EMPLOYMENT 
                    STATUS OF THE APPLICANT.</b></font></div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td width='4%' valign='top'><font face='Arial' size='2'><b>9.</b></font></td>
                <td width='96%'>
                  <div align='justify'><font face='Arial' size='2'><b>COMMERCIAL 
                    DOCUMENTS, I.E., CERTIFICATE FROM THE CHAMBER OF COMMERCE 
                    AND <font color='#FF0033'>INDUSTRY IN ORIGINAL</font>.</b></font></div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td width='4%' valign='top'><font face='Arial' size='2'><b>10.</b></font></td>
                <td width='96%'>
                  <div align='justify'><font face='Arial' size='2'><b>A FORMAL LETTER 
                    OF INVITATION FROM THE BUSINESS PARTNER IN CYPRUS (WITH DETAILS) 
                    MUST BE FAXED OVER TO THE HIGH COMMISSION FROM CYPRUS.</b></font></div>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr> 
                <td colspan='2' valign='top' height='2'><b><font size='2' face='Arial' color='#FF6600'>TIME 
                  TAKEN : 4 WORKING DAYS.</font></b></td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </td>
